UGC • Brand Deals • Social Media Marketing •AI •TikTok Creator Strategy | Faceless Blueprint ↓', 'https://www.tiktok.com/@empowerherceo', null, 1878, 91, 6.85, 2500, 'Beauty & Personal Care', '["Beauty & Personal Care"]', 53, null, null, 'New Lead', 'Anh Tuan (Scraper Bot)', null, null, null, null, null, '2026-08-02T07:20:56.964Z', '2026-08-10T21:50:38.741Z', '[]', '["TikTok Scraped","File Import (Kalodata_Creator_20260801193919_US.xlsx)","Scraper Enriched","Pickdi TCM Extension (handle-search)","Pickdi TCM Extension (auto-queue)"]', null, 73, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, '[{"id":"7669173105796877582","date":"2026-08-01","thumb":"","title":"I used to care way too much about what people might say if I started something online.  Then I was standing in the grocery store comparing prices, putting things back, and I had a weird thought... The people I was worried about weren''t standing there helping me make the budget work. I never thought about it like that until recently. It''s funny how we''ll let opinions from people who aren''t carrying our responsibilities decide whether we try something that could give us more options. I''m not saying stop caring what people think. I''m saying maybe their opinion shouldn''t matter more than the life you''re trying to build. Am I the only one who''s realized that a little late?   Follow if you''re looking for more options, not more pressure. #MomLife #SingleMom #WorkingMom #OverwhelmedMom #ExtraIncomeIdeas","views":312,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@empowerherceo/video/7669173105796877582","isBranded":false},{"id":"7671655690187984142","date":"2026-08-08","thumb":"","title":"You might already be doing the thing you think you need to learn. Think about it. You’re the person your friends ask where to eat. You’re sending people links to the dress you love. You’re recommending the skincare product that actually worked. You’re sharing the vacation spot everyone should know about. And you probably think, “I’m just sharing.” But look at what’s actually happening. You’re influencing decisions. You’re solving problems. You’re sharing knowledge. And people trust your recommendations. That’s value. And value is what businesses are built around. So before you start looking for another side hustle or thinking you have nothing to offer… Ask yourself: What do people already come to me for? Because you might not be starting from zero. You might just need to recognize what you already have. You might already be doing the thing you think you need to learn. You may not need another side hustle. You may need to recognize the value you’re already creating. The things people ask you about. The recommendations they trust. The problems you naturally solve. Start there. Comment “VALUE” if you want to learn how to identify what you could actually build around. #OnlineBusiness #MakeMoneyOnline #DigitalIncome #OnlineBusinessForBeginners #SideHustle","views":305,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@empowerherceo/video/7671655690187984142","isBranded":false},{"id":"7671377760450809102","date":"2026-08-07","thumb":"","title":"You don''t need another course... you need a clearer plan. I used to think the answer was buying more training. Another course. Another PDF. Another notebook full of notes. But here''s what I realized... My problem wasn''t a lack of information. It was that I didn''t know how all the pieces fit together. I didn''t understand: • Who I was creating content for. • Why my posts were getting views but not leading to sales. • How content was supposed to connect to an offer. Learning more wasn''t the missing piece. Clarity was. That''s why I''m documenting what I''m learning and simplifying it for other beginners who feel overwhelmed by all the advice online. If you''ve ever thought: \\"I bought the course... now what?\\" You''re not alone. Sometimes you don''t need more information—you need someone to help organize it into a plan you can actually follow. That''s exactly what I''m working on creating. Comment CLARITY if this sounds like where you are right now, and I''ll share the resource when it''s ready. Educational content only. I''m sharing what I''m learning and organizing along the way. Results vary, and there are no guarantees of income or business success.  #AffiliateMarketingTips #DigitalMarketingForBeginners #ContentCreator #ContentStrategy #ContentMarketing","views":232,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@empowerherceo/video/7671377760450809102","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":24,"topCountry":"TEXAS","topAgeGroup":"35-44","genderFemale":76,"ageDistribution":[{"name":"35-44","value":34},{"name":"45-54","value":28},{"name":"25-34","value":19},{"name":"55+","value":16},{"name":"18-24","value":3}],"countryDistribution":[{"name":"TEXAS","value":986},{"name":"CALIFORNIA","value":907},{"name":"FLORIDA","value":867},{"name":"GEORGIA","value":774},{"name":"NEW YORK","value":668}]}', null, false, null, null, null, null, null, '{"groups":[{"key":"followerTier","items":[{"key":"tier","label":"Follower tier","value":0.6,"weightPct":10}],"label":"Follower Tier","scorePct":60,"available":true,"weightPct":10},{"key":"gmvPerformance","items":[{"key":"gmvTier","label":"GMV tier so target L3","value":0.3,"weightPct":20},{"key":"gpm","label":"GPM (GMV/1000 views, USD)","value":1,"weightPct":15}],"label":"GMV Performance","scorePct":60,"available":true,"weightPct":35},{"key":"audienceProfileFit","items":[{"key":"genderFemale","label":"% nữ trong audience","value":0.8,"weightPct":12},{"key":"beautyCategoryRatio","label":"% nội dung beauty/personal care","value":1,"weightPct":12},{"key":"preferredAge","label":"% audience ở nhóm tuổi ưu tiên (35-44)","value":0.34,"weightPct":6}],"label":"Audience Profile Fit","scorePct":79,"available":true,"weightPct":30},{"key":"reachConsistency","items":[{"key":"avgViews","label":"Avg views/video","value":0,"weightPct":20}],"label":"Reach Consistency","scorePct":0,"availab