 Cheese Spread: 15 oz. ricotta cheese, 2 cups 1 large egg 2 cups mozzarella cheese, shredded  ¾ cup Parmesan cheese, shredded  2 teaspoons Italian seasoning ½ teaspoon salt ¼ tsp pepper Meat Sauce: 1 tablespoon olive oil 1 onion, finely diced 2.25 lb. ground beef 2 TBSP minced garlic ½ cup beef broth 40 oz. Raos marinara sauce 1 teaspoon Worcestershire sauce Lasagna Noodles/ Cheese Topping: 12 lasagna noodles 2.5 cups mozzarella cheese Prep Instructions:  Combine the cheese spread ingredients in a medium bowl and set aside.  Make the Meat Sauce: Heat olive oil over medium heat and add the diced onions. Let them soften for 10 minutes.  Add the ground beef. Cook for 8-10 minutes. Add garlic during the last minute. Drain excess grease.Add the beef broth, marinara sauce, and Worcestershire sauce. Bring to a boil, then reduce to a simmer. Cover partially and let the sauce simmer gently while you boil the pasta noodles. Assemble: Spread 1 cup of meat sauce on the bottom of a 9 x 13-inch casserole dish. Next, add 4 lasagna noodles, overlapping them if needed. Spread 1/3 of the cheese spread mixture over the noodles, followed by about 1 ½ cups of meat sauce. Continue layering. Top with 2 ½ cups of mozzarella cheese. Bake for 35 minutes. Enjoy! #EasyRecipe #lasagnarecipe #motherdaughter #cookathome #simplerecipe @graciehknight","views":37298,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@tarahood03/video/7662974665299709215","isBranded":false},{"id":"7666473214691872031","date":"2026-07-25","thumb":"","title":"Beautiful boat day with the fam on the intercoastal @Orange Beach Alabama ☀️🏝️#orangebeach #boatday #summerdays #familyfun #momanddaughters @graciehknight @Grey","views":35882,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@tarahood03/video/7666473214691872031","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":13,"topCountry":"GEORGIA","topAgeGroup":"25-34","genderFemale":87,"ageDistribution":[{"name":"25-34","value":31},{"name":"35-44","value":22},{"name":"45-54","value":21},{"name"