Detroit, MI📍', 'https://tiktok.com/@malietherapeuticmispa', null, 189762, 962, 7.51, 79318.82, 'Beauty & Personal Care', '["Beauty & Personal Care","Womenswear & Underwear","Sports & Outdoor"]', 71, null, null, 'New Lead', 'Anh Tuan (Scraper Bot)', null, null, null, null, null, '2026-08-04T12:07:50.290Z', '2026-08-09T19:02:52.881Z', '[]', '["TikTok Scraped","Pickdi TCM Extension","United States","Scraper Enriched","Pickdi TCM Extension (auto-queue)"]', null, 174, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, '[{"id":"7661820602839272734","date":"2026-07-13","thumb":"","title":"Nothing beats good hand massage especially when your girl works with her hands all day long🙌🏻 Follow for more🤍 #handmassage #howtomassage #massagetherapy #partnermassage","views":284786,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@malietherapeuticmispa/video/7661820602839272734","isBranded":false},{"id":"7662951865105091871","date":"2026-07-16","thumb":"","title":"It’s never been easier to give your girl relief🙌🏻 Slow and steady is the name of the game, so move at a snails pace🐌 Save this to try on her tonight and follow for more🤍 #partnermassage #howtomassage #upperbackmassage #massagetherapy #relationships","views":246591,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@malietherapeuticmispa/video/7662951865105091871","isBranded":false},{"id":"7668361166988659999","date":"2026-07-30","thumb":"","title":"Partner massage is the language of love.  When I was working with pregnant clients, I noticed something over and over again.. They aren’t just looking for pain relief, it was that AND craving the feeling of being cared for. Because pregnancy is incredible but it can also be uncomfortable. You experience sore hips, aching backs, heavy legs, restless nights, and constant changes can leave you feeling like you’re carrying everything, literally and emotionally. So many partners want to help but they just don’t know how. They’ll say, “I wish there was something I could do.” Now there is. 🤍 After years of learning the body, massage techniques, and what actually helps people relax and feel supported, I created something I wish every expecting couple had: ✨ The Prenatal Partner Massage Course ✨ It’s officially live today. A step-by-step guide that teaches partners how to safely give a relaxing, confidence building massage from head to toe during pregnancy. Sometimes the most meaningful thing you can give someone isn’t a physical gift, it’s 30 minutes where they feel cared for, supported, and completely loved. If you’re expecting, or know someone who is, this was made for you. 🤍 Grab it with the link in my bio🫶🏼 #prenatal #partnermassage #prenatalmassage #mom #pregnancy","views":91171,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@malietherapeuticmispa/video/7668361166988659999","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":27,"topCountry":"CALIFORNIA","topAgeGroup":"25-34","genderFemale":73,"ageDistribution":[{"name":"25-34","value":43},{"name":"35-44","value":24},{"name":"18-24","value":17},{"name":"45-54","value":12},{"name":"55+","value":4}],"countryDistribution":[{"name":"CALIFORNIA","value":1172},{"name":"TEXAS","value":971},{"name":"NEW YORK","value":659},{"name":"FLORIDA","value":539},{"name":"ILLINOIS","value":437}]}', null, false, null, null, null, null, null, '{"groups":[{"key":"followerTier","items":[{"key":"tier","label":"Follower tier","value":1,"weightPct":10}],"label":"Follower Tier","scorePct":100,"available":true,"weightPct":10},{"key":"gmvPerformance","items":[{"key":"gmvTier","label":"GMV tier so target L3","value":0.65,"weightPct":20},{"key":"gpm","label":"GPM (GMV/1000 views, USD)","value":0.192,"weightPct":15}],"label":"GMV Performance","scorePct":45,"available":true,"weightPct":35},{"key":"audienceProfileFit","items":[{"key":"genderFemale","label":"% nữ trong audience","value":0.65,"weightPct":12},{"key":"beautyCategoryRatio","label":"% nội dung beauty/personal care","value":1,"weightPct":12},{"key":"preferredAge","label":"% audience