Sentimentalfragrancereviews@gmail.com', 'https://tiktok.com/@scentimentalman', null, 8528, 2879, 0.92, 38522.7, 'Beauty & Personal Care', '["Beauty & Personal Care","Home Supplies"]', 79, null, null, 'New Lead', 'Anh Tuan (Scraper Bot)', 'Sentimentalfragrancereviews@gmail.com', null, null, null, null, '2026-08-04T14:37:41.018Z', '2026-08-09T14:54:54.522Z', '[]', '["TikTok Scraped","Pickdi TCM Extension","United States","Scraper Enriched","Pickdi TCM Extension (auto-queue)"]', null, 99, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, '[{"id":"7663164964131163405","date":"2026-07-16","thumb":"","title":"“If you’re looking for a fresh, luxurious scent without the luxury price tag, you’ve got to check out Bujairami Hectic. Inspired by the iconic Louis Vuitton Imagination, it opens with vibrant citrus and ginger, flows into an aromatic tea accord, and finishes with a smooth woody amber base. It’s clean, uplifting, long-lasting, and a total compliment magnet. Grab yours today from my TikTok Shop before it’s gone!”  #fragrancetiktok #fragrancecommunity #PerfumeTok #fragrances #fyp @FragranceNet @Bujairami Perfumes","views":58992,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@scentimentalman/video/7663164964131163405","isBranded":false},{"id":"7666117565747449101","date":"2026-07-24","thumb":"","title":"Meet Karus Gold Absolu by Khadlaj—a fragrance that smells bold, polished, and incredibly luxurious. It opens bright and fresh, settles into a smooth floral heart, and finishes with a warm, woody musk that leaves a rich, unforgettable trail. This is the kind of scent that makes people stop and ask what you’re wearing. Perfect for date nights, special occasions, or anytime you want to smell confident and expensive. It’s available today in my TikTok Shop—get you some before it sells out!#FragranceTok #TikTokShop #DateNight #Cologne #Perfume @BeautyHouse US","views":27671,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@scentimentalman/video/7666117565747449101","isBranded":false},{"id":"7661147230203546893","date":"2026-07-11","thumb":"","title":"Toy Boy by Moschino is one of the most polarizing fragrances in the fragrance community—and that’s exactly why it has a reputation for being “one of the worst smelling” to some people. The opening is bold, spicy, and loaded with pink pepper, creating a sharp, almost medicinal impression that can catch people completely off guard. As it develops, the intense rose takes center stage, mixed with clove, nutmeg, and earthy woods. For those expecting a fresh, sweet, or traditionally masculine scent, the combination can come across as overly floral, metallic, or even reminiscent of potpourri. That said, fragrance is incredibly subjective. While many people can’t stand Toy Boy, others consider it a modern masterpiece because of its originality, exceptional performance, and the confidence it takes to wear something so different. It’s a fragrance that refuses to play it safe—and that’s exactly why it’s loved by some and disliked by others. Would you wear it, or is it a hard pass #fragrancetiktok #frangrance #fyp #PerfumeTok #dance","views":20681,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@scentimentalman/video/7661147230203546893","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":41,"topCountry":"CALIFORNIA","topAgeGroup":"35-44","genderFemale":59,"ageDistribution":[{"name":"35-44","value":32},{"name":"25-34","value":29},{"name":"45-54","value":22},{"name":"18-24","value":10},{"name":"55+","value":8}],"countryDistribution":[{"name":"CALIFORNIA","value":1385},{"name":"TEXAS","value":1291},{"name":"FLORIDA","value":734},{"name":"NEW YORK","value":655},{"name":"GEORGIA","value":478}]}', null, false, null, null, null, null, null, '{"groups":[{"key":"followerTier","items":[{"key":"tier","label":"Follower tier","value":0.6,"weightPct":10}],"label":"Follower Tier","scorePct":60,"available":true,"weightPct":10},{"key":"gmvPerformance","items":[{"key":"gmvTier","label":"GMV tier so target L3","value":1,"weightPct":