althygut #fitnesstok #kivvykombucha #debloatingtips","views":7101,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@montasiadiara/video/7666203602280664350","isBranded":false},{"id":"7669633900280335647","date":"2026-08-03","thumb":"","title":"Replying to @Gilli-Ann 🇯🇲 I''ve been using the SIOT Rice Jam Mask on the areas where I deal with uneven tone and dark spots - under my eyes, my elbows, armpits, my knees, my thighs, and my neck. The rice extract in this mask helps brighten the areas that stay darker from friction and buildup, especially the spots that never lighten with regular products. Under my eyes, it helps reduce the look of dark circles and makes the skin appear more even. On my elbows and knees, it works on the darker patches that come from constant movement and rubbing. On my neck, it helps brighten the tone so it doesn''t look shadowed or uneven. I rub it in for 5 minutes in circular motion then just wipe it off, it absorbs slowly, and consistently improves the look of each area. Every spot I apply it to ends up looking more balanced, more even, and visibly brighter over time. @Siot Store US  #SIOTRiceJamMask #RiceExtractBrightening #DarkSpotCare #EvenToneRoutine #brighteningmask","views":3599,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@montasiadiara/video/7669633900280335647","isBranded":false},{"id":"7665862995968281887","date":"2026-07-23","thumb":"","title":"Replying to @Gilli-Ann 🇯🇲  I’ve been using the SIOT Rice Jam Mask on the areas where I deal with uneven tone and dark spots — under my eyes, my elbows, armpits, my knees, my thighs, and my neck. The rice extract in this mask helps brighten the areas that stay darker from friction and buildup, especially the spots that never lighten with regular products. Under my eyes, it helps reduce the look of dark circles and makes the skin appear more even. On my elbows and knees, it works on the darker patches that come from constant movement and rubbing. On my neck, it helps brighten the tone so it doesn’t look shadowed or u