📧: cherie@456growth.com', 'https://tiktok.com/@saltsugarandstories', null, 406709, 14190, 10.95, 54000.55, 'Beauty & Personal Care', '["Beauty & Personal Care","Womenswear & Underwear","Home Supplies"]', 82, null, null, 'New Lead', 'Anh Tuan (Scraper Bot)', 'cherie@456growth.com', null, null, null, null, '2026-08-05T11:02:16.831Z', '2026-08-06T04:49:24.630Z', '[]', '["TikTok Scraped","Pickdi TCM Extension","United States","Scraper Enriched","Pickdi TCM Extension (auto-queue)"]', null, 121, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, '[{"id":"7662912176629370126","date":"2026-07-16","thumb":"","title":"I have heard the song “Luckenbach, Texas” my entire life… and somehow I always imagined it was an actual little town. Y’all… imagine our surprise when we pulled in and realized Luckenbach IS basically the dance hall, the old post office/general store, the saloon, and a handful of historic buildings! 😂 And honestly? I think that made me love it even more. Luckenbach began as a German settlement in the late 1840s, when German immigrants settled along Grape Creek. The community grew around a general store, post office, saloon, dance hall, school, and blacksmith shop. At its peak in the early 1900s, nearly 500 people lived there before the population slowly declined over the decades.   One thing that fascinated me was learning how so many of these Hill Country communities were established close enough together that people traveling by horse and wagon could make it from one settlement to the next in a day’s journey. It made so much sense once our guide explained it. Then came 1971. The tiny town was purchased by the legendary John Russell “Hondo” Crouch, along with partners Guich Koock and Kathy Morgan. Hondo declared himself the “Mayor” and “Clown Prince of Luckenbach” and turned this nearly forgotten little place into a Texas icon where “Everybody’s Somebody.” Sadly, Hondo passed away from a heart attack in 1976, just one year before Waylon Jennings made Luckenbach famous around the world with the song we all know today.   Standing where generations of Texans danced, gathered, laughed, and made music was one of those moments that reminded me why I love traveling so much. Sometimes the smallest places end up leaving the biggest impression. If you’re anywhere near Fredericksburg, don’t skip Luckenbach. It may be tiny… but the history, the music, and the heart of the place are absolutely larger than life. ❤️🤠🎶 #luckenbachtexas #history #texas #story #smalltown","views":279199,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@saltsugarandstories/video/7662912176629370126","isBranded":false},{"id":"7667384691623808270","date":"2026-07-28","thumb":"","title":"French Onion Chicken Casserole  * 1 rotisserie chicken chopped (about 3 cups) * 2 cans Campbell’s Cream of Chicken Soup with Herbs (or Plain with added seasoning) * 1 packet Lipton Onion Soup Mix * 6 oz colby jack cheese freshly shredded * 8 oz sour cream * ¾ cup mayonnaise * 12 oz wide egg noodles cooked al dente * 8 slices thinly sliced provolone deli-style * 2 tbsp melted butter * 1 cup French fried onions INSTRUCTIONS Preheat oven to 350°F Boil egg noodles in salted water until al dente, then drain Chop rotisserie chicken into bite-sized cubes  In a large bowl, mix together: Chicken Mayo Sour cream Lipton onion soup mix Colby jack cheese Cooked noodles Cream of chicken soup Transfer mixture to a baking dish Lay provolone slices evenly over the top Mix melted butter with French fried onions and sprinkle over cheese Bake for 30 minutes, until hot, bubbly, and golden on top. #recipes #dinnerideas #dinner #easyrecipe #easyweeknightmeals @Emily-Anne Leone Boulay @Melissajorealrecipes @Blue Plate Mayonnaise @Campbell’s Soup","views":144211,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@saltsugarandstories/video/7667384691623808270","isBranded":false},{"id":"7669062279517768974","date":"2026-08-01","thumb":"","title":"Y’all have been asking forever to see my house, so today I’m finally giving you a little tour! 🏡 I’m showing you the parts of our home I’m comfortable sharing… the living room, Kenny’s “man cave” (which used to be our dining room 🤣), a few projects we still need to tackle, and my favorite part… our back porch, pool, and backyard. No bedroom tour, though. Kenny won’t have it. 😂 I hope y’all enjoy getting a little peek into the place we call home.❤️ #home #tour #hometour #housetour #house @Kenny Leone @Kenny Leone @Cove Soda","views":138432,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@saltsugarandstories/video/7669062279517768974","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":19,"topCountry":"TEXAS","topAgeGroup":"45-54","genderFemale":81,"ageDistribution":[{"name":"45-54","value":32},{"name":"55+","value":31},{"name":"35-44","value":20},{"name":"25-34","value":13},{"name":"18-24","value":4}],"countryDistribution":[{"name":"TEXAS","value":1255},{"name":"GEORGIA","value":715},{"name":"CALIFORNIA","value":611},{"name":"FLORIDA","value":559},{"name":"NORTH CAROLINA","value":468}]}', null, false, null, null, null, null, null, '{"groups":[{"key":"followerTier","items":[{"key":"tier","label":"Follower tier","value":1,"weightPct":10}],"label":"Follower Tier","scorePct":100,"available":true,"weightPct":10},{"key":"gmvPerformance","items":[{"key":"gmvTier","label":"GMV tier so target L3","value":1,"weightPct":20},{"key":"gpm","label":"GPM (GMV/1000 views, USD)","value":1,"weightPct":15}],"label":"GMV Performance","scorePct":100,"available":true,"weightPct":35},{"key":"audienceProfileFit","items":[{"key":"genderFemale","label":"% nữ trong audience","value":1,"weightPct":12},{"key":"beautyCategoryRatio","label":"% nội dung beauty/personal care","value":0,"weightPct":12},{"key":"preferredAge","label":"% audience ở nhóm tuổi ưu tiên (35-44)","value":0.2,"weightPct":6}],"label":"Audience Profile Fit","scorePct":44,"available":true,"weightPct":30},{"key":"reachConsistency","items":[{"key":"avgViews","label":"Avg views/video","value":1,"weightPc