⬇️', 'https://www.tiktok.com/@camillecowher', null, 260500, 50579, 2.79, 500.37, 'Beauty & Personal Care', '["Beauty & Personal Care"]', 87, null, null, 'New Lead', 'Anh Tuan (Scraper Bot)', null, null, null, null, null, '2026-08-06T09:42:52.793Z', '2026-08-07T08:05:10.164Z', '[]', '["TikTok Scraped","File Import (Kalodata_Creator_20260806172324_US.xlsx)","Scraper Enriched","Pickdi TCM Extension (handle-search)","Pickdi TCM Extension (auto-queue)","File Import (Kalodata_Creator_20260807160415_US.xlsx)"]', null, 49, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, '[{"id":"7667591848428424462","date":"2026-07-28","thumb":"","title":"Brows uneven? Try tiny dots. This silent brow tutorial shows my easy dot method for lining up both brows before filling them in. I use small guide dots to mark the front, arch, and tail so the brows look more even without guessing or overthinking the shape. #BrowTutorial #SparseBrows #Over50Makeup #MatureBeauty #BrowTips","views":730649,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@camillecowher/video/7667591848428424462","isBranded":false},{"id":"7668375864815422734","date":"2026-07-30","thumb":"","title":"Uneven brows? Map them first. Your brows may look crooked because your natural brow hairline is not the same on both sides. Instead of following the hair, I place guide dots first: two at the front to set where the brow starts and how thick it is, two around the arch so both brows taper the same, then I fill in. I’m using NYX Blade & Shade to create a more even brow shape without guessing. This video features affiliate products. I may earn a small commission from purchases at no extra cost to you. #UnevenBrows #BrowTutorial #NYXCosmetics #Over50Makeup #MatureBeauty","views":97736,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@camillecowher/video/7668375864815422734","isBranded":false},{"id":"7660960321758121230","date":"2026-07-10","thumb":"","title":"Invisible brows? Tinted gel helps. If your brow hairs are white, gray, or too light to see, a clear brow product may not do much. I’m using Billion Dollar Beauty tinted brow gel to add natural-looking color, flexible hold, and a softer brow-tint effect without making my brows look drawn on or glued down. This video contains affiliate links. If you purchase through my links, I may earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. #TintedBrowGel #GrayBrows #Over50Makeup #MatureBeauty #SparseBrows","views":24639,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@camillecowher/video/7660960321758121230","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":19,"topCountry":"TEXAS","topAgeGroup":"55+","genderFemale":81,"ageDistribution":[{"name":"55+","value":46},{"name":"45-54","value":36},{"name":"35-44","value":13},{"name":"25-34","value":4},{"name":"18-24","value":2}],"countryDistribution":[{"name":"TEXAS","value":1104},{"name":"CALIFORNIA","value":1081},{"name":"FLORIDA","value":625},{"name":"NEW YORK","value":574},{"name":"GEORGIA","value":445}]}', null, false, null, null, null, null, null, '{"groups":[{"key":"followerTier","items":[{"key":"tier","label":"Follower tier","value":1,"weightPct":10}],"label":"Follower Tier","scorePct":100,"available":true,"weightPct":10},{"key":"gmvPerformance","items":[{"key":"gmvTier","label":"GMV tier so target L3","value":0.65,"weightPct":20},{"key":"gpm","label":"GPM (GMV/1000 views, USD)","value":1,"weightPct":15}],"label":"GMV Performance","scorePct":80,"available":true,"weightPct":35},{"key":"audienceProfileFit","items":[{"key":"genderFemale","label":"% nữ trong audience","value":1,"weightPct":12},{"key":"beautyCategoryRatio","label":"% nội dung beauty/personal care","value":1,"weightPct":12},{"key":"preferredAge","label":"% audience ở nhóm tuổi ưu tiên (35-44)","value":0.13,"weightPct":6}],"label":"Audience Profile Fit","scorePct":83,"available":true,"weightPct":30},{"key":"reachConsistency","items":[{"key":"avgViews","label":"Avg views/video","value":1,"weightPct":20}],"label":"Reach Consistency","scorePct":100,"availab