al bacon chunks in them . I got churros for dessert and my husband got a cookie dessert. I don’t remember the name of it, but it was so good. It had chunks of cookies and whipped cream with ice cream. It was so good. Their menu is loaded with so many choices and next time we will be trying their appetizers and probably one of their burgers because their burgers look so good. I highly recommend this restaurant as one of Alabama‘s  Number 1 best hidden restaurant if you’re going to a game this is a must stop. You can get off the interstate very easy to get there ##foodie@@AlabamaRadio@@Alabama Football@@Alabama Crimson Tide on AL.com@@UNIVERSITY OF ALABAMA##tuscaloosa##eatlocal##everyonesfyp##mustvisit@@WBRC 6 News@@ABC 33/40 News@@104.7 WZZK@@Tuscaloosa","views":16969,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@alabamanana68/video/7669634390200306958","isBranded":false},{"id":"7669206228777618701","date":"2026-08-03","thumb":"","title":"This is the cutest little monster wearable blanket. This would be a cute Halloween costume. We use this winter when it’s cold and you need to go outside. Use it to lounge around in to watch TV and would be a great Christmas gift too. Isn’t it cute #wearableblanket #halloweencostume #loungewear #littlemonster #everyonesfyp","views":3330,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@alabamanana68/video/7669206228777618701","isBranded":false},{"id":"7663944063585930510","date":"2026-07-20","thumb":"","title":"These pajamas are soft, comfortable in the rainbow bright #pajamas #rainbowbright123 #pjs #spotlightfashion #genx","views":2000,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@alabamanana68/video/7663944063585930510","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":17,"topCountry":"TEXAS","topAgeGroup":"45-54","genderFemale":83,"ageDistribution":[{"name":"45-54","value":30},{"name":"35-44","value":26},{"name":"55+","value":23},{"name":"25-34","value":18},{"name":"18-24","value":3}],"countryDistribution":[{"name":"TEXAS","value":997},{"name":"GEORGIA","v