eve in clean fun, intentional family time, and building a home filled with love—all for the glory of God. 🕊️ ​Join our journey of faith, love, and laughter through our weekly vlogs. We’re here to share the big milestones and the small, everyday moments of grace. We invite you to be part of our story, to grow with us, and to find a little extra encouragement today! 🏠🙌🏾 ​#TheWilliamsonFamily #FaithFamilyFun #WeeklyVlogs #WholesomeLiving #GodsGraceEveryday","views":1096,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@lifewithleviandke/video/7669175658689482015","isBranded":false},{"id":"7668734287327464735","date":"2026-07-31","thumb":"","title":"Hey everyone! Most people know us as the Williamsons. Welcome to Life with Levi and Ke! Serving God while being authentically us is exactly what you will find here. ​We’re dedicated to faith, love, and laughter. We treat this channel like a direct window into our lives—meaning we don''t stick to a rigid upload schedule! We love being spontaneous, so turn on notifications so you never miss a surprise drop! ​Whenever we post, you can count on us diving into what matters most: ​Faith & Ministry: Growing together and building a community rooted in His Word. ​Marriage & Family: Transparent, encouraging chats about building a strong, godly home and relationships. ​Business & Growth: Practical wisdom, coaching, and tools to help you build your own legacy. ​Food & Lifestyle: Homemade cooking, artisanal sourdough, and everyday joy at our table. ​We’re here to inspire, uplift, and do it all for the glory of God. Subscribe and join our journey! Stay Connected: ​Linktree coming soon! . . #TheWilliamsonFamily #familyoffaith #spreadingthegospel  #letstalkaboutit #settingthetablegodsway","views":1033,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@lifewithleviandke/video/7668734287327464735","isBranded":false},{"id":"7671016998658116894","date":"2026-08-06","thumb":"","title":"Check this out, ladies: I''ve found the perfect way to keep our decks and outdoor seating areas clear without having to dig through the garage for heavy tools. This 21-volt handheld blower is lightweight and so easy to use, making quick work of leaves in high-traffic areas. ​ #DeckMaintenance #OutdoorLiving #SEESE #LadiesDIY #LeafBlower .","views":991,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@lifewithleviandke/video/7671016998658116894","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":18,"topCountry":"TEXAS","topAgeGroup":"55+","genderFemale":82,"ageDistribution":[{"name":"55+","value":34},{"name":"45-54","value":33},{"name":"35-44","value":19},{"name":"25-34","value":9},{"name":"18-24","value":5}],"countryDistribution":[{"name":"TEXAS","value":1012},{"name":"GEORGIA","value":882},{"name":"FLORIDA","value":688},{"name":"NORTH CAROLINA","value":679},{"name":"NEW YORK","value":539}]}', null, false, null, null, null, null, null, '{"groups":[{"key":"followerTier","items":[{"key":"tier","label":"Follower tier","value":0.8,"weightPct":10}],"label":"Follower Tier","scorePct":80,"available":true,"weightPct":10},{"key":"gmvPerformance","items":[{"key":"gmvTier","label":"GMV tier so target L3","value":0.3,"weightPct":20},{"key":"gpm","label":"GPM (GMV/1000 views, USD)","value":0.38499999999999995,"weightPct":15}],"label":"GMV Performance","scorePct":34,"available":true,"weightPct":35},{"key":"audienceProfileFit","items":[{"key":"genderFemale","label":"% nữ trong audience","value":1,"weightPct":12},{"key":"beautyCategoryRatio","label":"% nội dung beauty/personal care","value":0,"weightPct":12},{"key":"preferredAge","label":"% audience ở nhóm tuổi ưu tiên (35-44)","value":0.19,"weightPct":6}],"label":"Audience Profile Fit","scorePct":44,"available":true,"weightPct":30},{"key":"reachConsistency","items":[{"key":"avgViews","label":"Avg views/video","value":0,"weightPct":20}],"label":"Reach Consistency","scorePct":0,"available":true,"weightPct":20}],"scoredAt":"2026-08-09T03:35:18.336Z","riskFlags":[],"strengths":["% nữ trong audience (Audience Profile Fit)","Follo