al murder, a man claiming to be her current boyfriend commented on my video, insisting investigators have the wrong person. He claims Mayra and Irasema were good friends, believes the person seen on surveillance is a man, and says Mayra “couldn’t hurt a fly.” Meanwhile, investigators say the case was reopened using investigative genetic genealogy after developing a DNA profile from blood recovered at the crime scene, which ultimately led to Mayra’s arrest more than 14 years later. Court records now show Mayra Velasquez’s bond has been set at $500,000, and we’re still waiting to learn what additional evidence prosecutors will present. Remember, these are allegations, and Mayra Velasquez is presumed innocent unless proven guilty in court. What do you think? 👇 #MayraVelasquez #IrasemaChavez #truecrime #ColdCase #ArlingtonTX","views":58122,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@flawlessnina/video/7665408294617484574","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":17,"topCountry":"TEXAS","topAgeGroup":"35-44","genderFemale":83,"ageDistribution":[{"name":"35-44","value":30},{"name":"25-34","value":28},{"name":"45-54","value":22},{"name":"55+","value":12},{"name":"18-24","value":8}],"countryDistribution":[{"name":"TEXAS","value":1012},{"name":"CALIFORNIA","value":826},{"name":"NEW YORK","value":622},{"name":"FLORIDA","value":603},{"name":"GEORGIA","value":547}]}', null, false, null, null, null, null, null, '{"groups":[{"key":"followerTier","items":[{"key":"tier","label":"Follower tier","value":1,"weightPct":10}],"label":"Follower Tier","scorePct":100,"available":true,"weightPct":10},{"key":"gmvPerformance","items":[{"key":"gmvTier","label":"GMV tier so target L3","value":0.3,"weightPct":20},{"key":"gpm","label":"GPM (GMV/1000 views, USD)","value":1,"weightPct":15}],"label":"GMV Performance","scorePct":60,"available":true,"weightPct":35},{"key":"audienceProfileFit","items":[{"key":"genderFemale","label":"% nữ trong audience","value":1,"weightPct":12},{"key":"beautyC