hello@candicenikeia.com', 'https://www.tiktok.com/@candicenikeia', null, 237267, 1375, 1.53, 24742.37, 'Luggage & Bags', '["Luggage & Bags","Sports & Outdoor","Health"]', 84, null, null, 'New Lead', 'Anh Tuan (Scraper Bot)', 'hello@candicenikeia.com', null, null, null, null, '2026-08-07T08:05:10.173Z', '2026-08-09T00:12:20.324Z', '[]', '["TikTok Scraped","File Import (Kalodata_Creator_20260807160415_US.xlsx)","Scraper Enriched","Pickdi TCM Extension (handle-search)","Pickdi TCM Extension (auto-queue)"]', null, 40, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, '[{"id":"7668364488755711262","date":"2026-07-30","thumb":"","title":"❤️✨ AT HOME LIGHT THERAPY MASK ✨❤️ I’m 37, and one thing nursing school taught me completely changed the way I approach skincare. ✨🤍 At 37, I’m not looking for quick fixes anymore—I’m focused on taking care of my skin at a deeper level. One of the biggest things I learned in nursing school is that if you want to see lasting changes in your skin, you have to support the dermis, not just the epidermis. That’s exactly why LED light therapy has become a non-negotiable part of my skincare routine. This wireless LED mask makes it so easy. I cleanse my face, apply my favorite skincare products, put the mask on, choose my light setting, and relax for 15 minutes while it does the work. It even shuts off automatically. What I love most is that it has 7 different light settings plus an Auto Mode that cycles through every color, so you can customize your treatment based on your skin’s needs. ❤️ Red Light (630nm) • Supports collagen production • Softens the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles • Improves the look of skin firmness and elasticity • Helps promote smoother, healthier-looking skin 💙 Blue Light (465-470nm) • Helps target acne-causing bacteria • Reduces the appearance of blemishes • Helps control excess oil • Supports clearer-looking skin 💚 Green Light (520-525nm) • Helps fade the appearance of dark spots • Targets hyperpigmentation • Promotes a more even-looking skin tone 💛 Yellow/Orange Light (590-610nm) • Helps reduce the appearance of redness • Brightens dull-looking skin • Promotes a healthy, radiant glow 💜 Purple Light • Combines the benefits of red and blue light • Helps calm blemish-prone skin • Supports skin recovery 🩵 Cyan Light • Helps soothe irritated-looking skin • Reduces the appearance of redness • Leaves skin looking calmer 🤍 White Light • Supports overall skin rejuvenation • Helps improve the appearance of aging skin • Promotes healthier-looking skin Other features I love: ✨ Wireless charging ✨ Lightweight design (comfortable to wear) ✨ 90 LED beads for even light coverage ✨ Adjustable head strap ✨ One-touch operation ✨ Eye protection design ✨ Automatic shutoff timer after 15 minutes ✨ Multiple treatment modes plus Auto Mode For me, this is one of those self-care habits that actually feels relaxing while supporting my long-term skincare goals. I usually use it while reading, watching TV, or winding down before bed. Sometimes the best skincare isn’t another serum—it’s giving your skin the technology to support itself. TikTok Shop, LED light therapy mask, red light therapy, LED face mask, anti-aging skincare, collagen support, fine lines, wrinkles, firm skin, glowing skin, glass skin, acne skincare, blue light therapy, green light therapy, dark spots, hyperpigmentation, uneven skin tone, skin rejuvenation, skin tightening, red light therapy benefits, skincare routine, nursing school skincare, dermis skincare, anti-aging device, beauty technology, at-home facial, facial device, Korean skincare routine, skincare tools, self-care routine, wellness routine, esthetician favorites, beauty gadgets, healthy aging, skincare over 35, skincare over 30, 37 and thriving, viral TikTok finds, beauty favorites, med spa at home, luxury skincare, LED facial mask, collagen boosting, skin health, nightly skincare routine, skincare investment, wireless LED mask, beauty routine 🤍✨ #skincareover30 #skincareroutine #lighttherapyskincare #ledmask #redlighttherapy","views":103697,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@candicenikeia/video/7668364488755711262","isBranded":false},{"id":"7670216551018122526","date":"2026-08-05","thumb":"","title":"❤️ THR BEST TOTE BAG ❤️ This bag looks like it belongs on the Amalfi Coast… not in my TikTok Shop cart. 🇮🇹💚✨ If you love that effortless European luxury look, this tote is going to become your new obsession. It has the most beautiful woven design, a structured silhouette, and comes with a matching mini pouch that’s perfect for your cards, lip gloss, keys, or other small essentials. One of my favorite things is that you can choose from three different sizes, so there’s literally one for every lifestyle: 👜 Small (28 × 21 × 15 cm) – Perfect as an everyday handbag. 💻 Medium (47 × 27 × 15 cm) – Fits your laptop, planner, water bottle, makeup bag, and everything you need for work or school. ✈️ Large (56 × 30 × 15 cm) – The ultimate travel, beach, weekend getaway, or carry-on tote. It also comes in so many gorgeous colors: 🖤 Black 💙 Navy 💚 Dark Green 🎃 Pumpkin 💛 Chrome Yellow 🤎 Bronze ❤️ Red This is the kind of bag that instantly elevates any outfit. Whether you’re wearing leggings and sneakers, a linen set on vacation, or heading into the office, it gives that timeless designer-inspired look without the luxury price tag. It’s spacious, lightweight, classic, and one of those pieces you’ll reach for every single day. If your Pinterest board is full of quiet luxury, old money style, capsule wardrobes, or Amalfi Coast summers… this bag belongs in your collection. TikTok Shop, luxury tote bag, woven tote bag, everyday tote, work tote, travel tote, beach bag, oversized tote, medium tote bag, small handbag, large carryall, laptop bag, matching pouch, designer inspired bag, quiet luxury, old money aesthetic, Amalfi Coast aesthetic, Italian summer, coastal European style, luxury handbag, everyday luxury, work bag, mom bag, travel essentials, capsule wardrobe, timeless fashion, classy style, rich girl aesthetic, elegant accessories, women’s handbags, fashion finds, viral tote bag, affordable luxury, TikTok made me buy it. 💚👜✨ #totebags #totebagaesthetic #totebaggirlies #everydaybag #travelbag","views":34838,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@candicenikeia/video/7670216551018122526","isBranded":false},{"id":"7663563123764251935","date":"2026-07-17","thumb":"","title":"🌸✨ TOTE BAG SUMMER ✨🌸 The tote that makes everyone think you have your life together. 👜✨ There’s something about a structured tote that instantly pulls an outfit together—and this one has become one of my favorite everyday bags. It’s roomy enough to fit all of my daily essentials without feeling bulky, and the matching zip pouch is perfect for keeping my makeup, AirPods, keys, or other small items from getting lost at the bottom of my bag. Whether you’re headed to the office, nursing school, the airport, brunch, coffee runs, or a weekend getaway, this is the kind of tote you’ll end up carrying everywhere. It has that timeless, polished look that pairs effortlessly with everything from leggings and sneakers to blazers and dresses. I also love that it comes in four gorgeous colors: 💙 Navy for a classic, sophisticated look. 🖤 Black if you love timeless wardrobe staples. 💚 Dark Green for a rich, elevated neutral. 🧡 Pumpkin if you want a warm statement color that still feels chic. It’s practical, stylish, and one of those bags that makes your everyday outfits look so much more expensive. TikTok Shop, tote bag, luxury tote, everyday tote, navy tote bag, black tote bag, dark green handbag, pumpkin tote bag, work bag, laptop tote, travel tote, airport bag, nursing school bag, teacher bag, office handbag, everyday purse, matching pouch, structured tote, women’s handbag, quiet luxury, old money aesthetic, capsule wardrobe, minimalist style, luxury look for less, work essentials, chic accessories, timeless fashion, viral TikTok finds, women’s fashion, everyday luxury 👜✨💙🖤💚🧡 #totebag #totebagaesthetic #totebags #totebagstyle #totebaggirlies","views":24304,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@candicenikeia/video/7663563123764251935","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":14,"topCountry":"CALIFORNIA","topAgeGroup":"25-34","genderFemale":86,"ageDistribution":[{"name":"25-34","value":35},{"name":"18-24","value":28},{"name":"35-44","value":21},{"name":"45-54","value":11},{"name":"55+","value":5}],"countryDistribution":[{"name":"CALIFORNIA","value":1198},{"name":"TEXAS","value":1007},{"name":"NEW YORK","value":793},{"name":"FLORIDA","value":701},{"name":"GEORGIA","value":491}]}', null, false, null, null, null, null, null, '{"groups":[{"key":"followerTier","items":[{"key":"tier","label":"Follower tier","value":1,"weightPct":10}],"label":"Follower Tier","scorePct":100,"available":true,"weightPct":10},{"key":"gmvPerformance","items":[{"key":"gmvTier","label":"GMV tier so target L3","value":0.65,"weightPct":20},{"key":"gpm","label":"GPM (GMV/1000 views, USD)","value":1,"weightPct":15}],"label":"GMV Performance","scorePct":80,"available":true,"weightPct":35},{"key":"audienceProfileFit","items":[{"key":"genderFemale","label":"% nữ trong audience","value":1,"weightPct":12},{"key":"preferredAge","label":"% audience ở nhóm tuổi ưu tiên (35-44)","value":0.21,"weightPct":6}],"label":"Audience Profile Fit","scorePct":74,"available":true,"weightPct":30},{"key":"reachConsistency","items":[{"key":"avgViews","label":"Avg views/video","value":1,"weightPct":20}],"label":"Reach Consistency","scorePct":100,"available":true,"weightPct":20}],"scoredAt":"2026-08-09T00:12:20.929Z","riskFlags":[],"strengths":["Follower tier (Follower Tier)","GPM (GMV/1000 views, USD) (GMV Performance)","% nữ trong audience (Audience Profile Fit)"],"totalScore":84,"weaknesses":["% audience ở nhóm tuổi ưu tiên (35-44) (Audience Profile Fit)"],"recommendation":"Priority B - Recommended"}', null, 1786089910173, 33215, 'L2', 26.71, nu