e: • ½ cup butter • 2 cups heavy whipping cream • 1 tsp garlic • Salt, pepper & Italian seasoning (measure with your heart 😉) • 2 cups grated Parmesan cheese Cook your chicken and pasta separately, melt the butter, stir in the heavy cream and seasonings, then whisk in the Parmesan until smooth and creamy. Toss everything together and try not to eat half the pan before dinner. 😅 📌 Save this one for the nights you want everyone happy. 👏🏻 #creatorsearchinsights #dinnerrecipes #dinnerideas #homecooking","views":3965,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@livinlifeaslinds/video/7670899280550350111","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":11,"topCountry":"TEXAS","topAgeGroup":"25-34","genderFemale":89,"ageDistribution":[{"name":"25-34","value":48},{"name":"35-44","value":28},{"name":"45-54","value":10},{"name":"18-24","value":8},{"name":"55+","value":6}],"countryDistribution":[{"name":"TEXAS","value":808},{"name":"CALIFORNIA","value":566},{"name":"FLORIDA","value":548},{"name":"GEORGIA","value":546},{"name":"NEW YORK","value":545}]}', null, false, null, null, null, null, null, '{"groups":[{"key":"followerTier","items":[{"key":"tier","label":"Follower tier","value":0.8,"weightPct":10}],"label":"Follower Tier","scorePct":80,"available":true,"weightPct":10},{"key":"gmvPerformance","items":[{"key":"gmvTier","label":"GMV tier so target L3","value":0.3,"weightPct":20},{"key":"gpm","label":"GPM (GMV/1000 views, USD)","value":0.08499999999999996,"weightPct":15}],"label":"GMV Performance","scorePct":21,"available":true,"weightPct":35},{"key":"audienceProfileFit","items":[{"key":"genderFemale","label":"% nữ trong audience","value":1,"weightPct":12},{"key":"beautyCategoryRatio","label":"% nội dung beauty/personal care","value":0,"weightPct":12},{"key":"preferredAge","label":"% audience ở nhóm tuổi ưu tiên (35-44)","value":0.28,"weightPct":6}],"label":"Audience Profile Fit","scorePct":46,"available":true,"weightPct":30},{"key":"reachConsistency","items":[{"key":"avgVie