Makeup lover + Fine hair tips. Eczema journey.  My life 🫶 
💌 kayla@lucky8collective.com', 'https://www.tiktok.com/@klaxtniel', null, 127697, 2010, 6.27, 2899.41, 'Beauty & Personal Care', '["Beauty & Personal Care","Womenswear & Underwear","Fashion Accessories"]', 72, null, null, 'New Lead', 'Anh Tuan (Scraper Bot)', 'kayla@lucky8collective.com', null, null, null, null, '2026-08-07T08:05:10.178Z', '2026-08-08T21:07:40.971Z', '[]', '["TikTok Scraped","File Import (Kalodata_Creator_20260807160415_US.xlsx)","Scraper Enriched","Pickdi TCM Extension (handle-search)","Pickdi TCM Extension (auto-queue)"]', null, 9, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, '[{"id":"7667241672194985246","date":"2026-07-27","thumb":"","title":"To anyone who has never felt what it’s like to be mentally drained from eczema… we don’t need more creams. Hi I’m Kayla. 3 years ago acrylic nails ruined my life- and now I’m in a constant cycle of severe eczema (atopic dermatitis). It started on one finger and eventually my body was screaming for help… it spread to both of my hands, and now my arms. Constant blood work, visits to allergy specialists, dermatologists, doctors. Only to be prescribed more creams, use of steroids, medication, and medications / shots that would only suppress and wreck what my body was trying to regulate (my immune system).  AD has become my new normal. Everyday I can’t bend my fingers  or even make a fist. My hands are no longer normal. I feel defeated and I feel like everyday is a mental battle.  Last year I also went to the ER due to inflammation in my colon. I feel like everything is connected. I’m done with western medicine and there’s nothing more frustrating than trying to pinpoint personal triggers. But I’m on a journey to finding the root cause to all of this. With eczema, it isn’t a point a to point b solution. Healing is not overnight. I’ve decided I’m going to pay out of pocket for comprehensive testing. In the meantime, I’ll see you all soon with an update. 🤍  #eczema #atopicdermatits #eczemaflareup #acrylicnails #allergy","views":33321,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@klaxtniel/video/7667241672194985246","isBranded":false},{"id":"7662079695311080735","date":"2026-07-13","thumb":"","title":"Hawaii has some of the BEST Filipino home bakers and this pop up stand is TOO good 🤤🇵🇭🤌🏻✨ their next pop up is this weekend from July 17-18 !  📍follow them on IG for updates: @thesweetstand.hnl  #oahuhawaii #ube #matcha #filipinodessert #hawaiifoodie","views":15109,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@klaxtniel/video/7662079695311080735","isBranded":false},{"id":"7669875156457721118","date":"2026-08-03","thumb":"","title":"Creasing, fine lines or if you just have more mature skin.. switch to a hydrating, lightweight formula with medium buildable coverage!😍👏🏻 love this one from @Shop MAKE Beauty ! I can see why it won an award for being the best concealer🏆 #concealer #concealerreview #concealerbrush #makeupover30 #finelinesandwrinkles","views":2157,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@klaxtniel/video/7669875156457721118","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":34,"topCountry":"CALIFORNIA","topAgeGroup":"25-34","genderFemale":66,"ageDistribution":[{"name":"25-34","value":47},{"name":"35-44","value":23},{"name":"18-24","value":16},{"name":"45-54","value":10},{"name":"55+","value":4}],"countryDistribution":[{"name":"CALIFORNIA","value":2483},{"name":"TEXAS","value":1232},{"name":"NEW YORK","value":575},{"name":"FLORIDA","value":501},{"name":"HAWAII","value":393}]}', null, false, null, null, null, null, null, '{"groups":[{"key":"followerTier","items":[{"key":"tier","label":"Follower tier","value":1,"weightPct":10}],"label":"Follower Tier","scorePct":100,"available":true,"weightPct":10},{"key":"gmvPerformance","items":[{"key":"gmvTier","label":"GMV tier so target L3","value":0.3,"weightPct":20},{"key":"gpm","label":"GPM (GMV/1000 views, USD)","value":1,"weightPct":15}],"label":"GMV Performance","scorePct":60,"available":true,"weightPct":35},{"key":"aud