💌TLLteam@thelipsticklesbians.com', 'https://www.tiktok.com/@thelipsticklesbians', null, 1089327, 19463, 6.94, 2500, 'Beauty & Personal Care', '["Beauty & Personal Care"]', 78, null, null, 'New Lead', 'Anh Tuan (Scraper Bot)', 'TLLteam@thelipsticklesbians.com', null, null, null, null, '2026-08-07T08:05:10.179Z', '2026-08-08T20:04:02.893Z', '[]', '["TikTok Scraped","File Import (Kalodata_Creator_20260807160415_US.xlsx)","Scraper Enriched","Pickdi TCM Extension (handle-search)","Pickdi TCM Extension (auto-queue)"]', null, 43, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, null, '[{"id":"7665124532671221023","date":"2026-07-21","thumb":"","title":"DECONSTRUCTING @Too Faced’s new Peach Roller Ball Powder we got in PR 🍑👀Beauty queens, this was such an interesting one to take apart. I personally haven’t seen this style of packaging used for a loose powder before, so naturally my product developer brain got the best of me 😂 I had to crack it open and see exactly how it worked. But don’t worry, no powder was wasted! And surprisingly, this ended up being one of the cleanest deconstructions we’ve done compared to some of the others. I can definitely appreciate the engineering that went into making all of these components work together. It’s clear the team put a lot of thought into creating a unique dispensing system and I’m all for innovation! That said, it’s not something I’d personally reach for. Knowing you can’t access every last bit of product without eventually breaking the package open isn’t my favorite design choice. If you absolutely love the formula, the application experience, or you''re just a fan of the brand, that tradeoff may not matter to you at all though. As always it comes down to your personal preferences and what works best for your needs. 🙌What do you all think of this packaging? Is it a yay or a nay for you? Let’s discuss! #newmakeup #toofaced #beautyproducts #loosepowder #thelipsticklesbians","views":1187768,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@thelipsticklesbians/video/7665124532671221023","isBranded":false},{"id":"7662402831537769759","date":"2026-07-14","thumb":"","title":"Beauty queens, @KORRES is a brand we’ve spoken a lot about in the past and we couldn’t leave Greece without stopping by! 🇬🇷  They’re a Greek brand that sources ingredients from different Greek islands (including Crete where wifey and I are both from!) and manufactures everything locally. The Olive collection is one of their most iconic lines, and if you see the green olive soap, grab it 😅 I wanted to share my top picks with y’all from them while we were browsing this pharmacy but I’m so curious to know all your top picks too! Drop them in the comments for anyone looking for new products to try 👇#greekpharmacy #greekbeauty #beautyproducts #thelipsticklesbians #greecetravel","views":847496,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@thelipsticklesbians/video/7662402831537769759","isBranded":false},{"id":"7668785980060519694","date":"2026-07-31","thumb":"","title":"Got tagged and sent @emily harper’s video so much we also had to experiment! Especially after we also grew skeptical ourselves 🤔 Turns out these @Armani beauty blushes have about 2 grams of formula (or bulk as we call it in product development) sitting underneath the cup. Likely to do with it being poured as a liquid, moving through the crevices, and drying at the bottom. Legally net weight is the total amount of formula or bulk in a package. So Armani is legally correct as per their label! However, still not ideal for consumers missing out on using half the product. Now you know! To get those most use of these blushes, make sure to open underneath the cap. Thanks for this fun exploration Emily! ❤️ #makeup #depot #armanibeauty #blush","views":794484,"videoUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/@thelipsticklesbians/video/7668785980060519694","isBranded":false}]', '{"topGender":"Female","genderMale":14,"topCountry":"CALIFORNIA","topAgeGroup":"25-34","genderFemale":86,"ageDistribution":[